15	/// spike works together in one bootstrap, before anything else is built on
16	/// top of it (architecture spine's Deferred note).
17	///
18	/// No device/simulator/CI exists yet to run a true platform-channel
19	/// integration test (AGENTS.md's "Running and verifying" TODO), so the
20	/// native secure-storage channel is faked with an in-memory store here —
21	/// the test still exercises the *real* `FlutterSecureStorage` instance
22	/// resolved from the single DI container, round-tripping a write/read
23	/// through it exactly as AC4 requires.
24	void main() {
